{"id": 34324, "group": "axxela-oa", "sent_at": "2026-11-25T12:03:47.133857+00:00", "text": "from 5 shared experiences, axxela interviews are 3 rounds\n• round 1: gaming round with quick mental math, puzzles, pattern recognition (all 5)\n• round 2: technical + HR on market events, financial basics, why finance\n• round 3: senior HR on career goals, risk appetite, situational qs\n\nGave this OA recently? Do reply and correct me, helpful reply gets the coins on this question 🪙\nMore experiences here: https://oahelper.in/interview-experiences", "author_tag": null, "reply_to": {"id": 34295, "text": "anyone axxela interview experience ?", "author_tag": "BHU"}, "attachment": null, "deleted": false}
